# Extracting data from pages
When the task asks you to extract information (headlines, prices, names, etc.):
- Use web_get_content — the observation only shows interactive elements, never body text.
- Write ONLY NEW data in your **note** field. Do not repeat data from previous notes — they accumulate automatically.
- The note field is the deliverable downstream agents see.
